                                "text": "\"Observe the relative position,\" returned the Doctor with a smile. \"It is your attitude to believe through thick and thin in one man's judgment—your own. I follow the same opinion, but critically and with open eyes. Which is the more irrational—I leave it to yourself.\"\n\"Oh, my dear fellow!\" cried Casimir, \"[…] don't ratiocinate with me.\""
